      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HILLTOP STAR (1) was 6 metres away in second at Port Pirie over 1609m last start at her first run back from a spell. Sure to enjoy an economical run from this draw. Facing a tougher assignment but she is fitter and capable of running another big race. JUST INCREDIBLE (10) had been building to a win and it arrived last start when he scored by 3 metres over 1790m at this track. Hard to know where he gets from this slightly awkward draw. Leading hope in a similar race. KYORETSU (11) is in the mix following a respectable second at his most recent appearance over 1750m at Swan Hill. RIVERGUM VELOX (8) saluted two runs ago at Globe Derby Park then kept the outstanding form going last time when he got home by 1.5 metres over 1800m at Globe Derby Park. Key runner who can make his presence felt.",
